0320-negroni-wlan-cfg-mode: Wi-Fi level 7 (negroniwlan=7), QMI WLAN_CFG + WLAN_MODE mission, steps 25-26.
WLAN_CFG (ath11k qmi.c:2695): host "WIN", the 9 target CE pipes and 14 service routes of ath11k
qca6390/wcn6855 (hw.c:1623/:1720), 30 shadow registers v2 in the ath11k order (ce.c:840; table in the new
bsd/dev/negroni_wlan_ce.h); WLAN_MODE mission (qmi.c:2640). New QMI field tables in negroni_wlfw_tables.h.
Also: the DMA-address seam negroni_wlan_dma_map (every chip address goes through it; identity here),
a keep-alive poller after the last level (IOSleep 20 ms, MHI + QRTR + later pollers, negroniwlan_keep=S),
negroniwlan_hostcap=android (HOST_CAP feature_list 0x7 + gpios {0x38242f00}, cnss2 qmi.c:258-331),
M1 -> MHISTATE M2 + wake 1 (pm.c:341-359). Details: patches/xnu/README-wifi.md "0320".

